# Grounded findings
queue-tools.ts dequeue_goal:
- removes the first queue item immediately
- persists dequeue with reason "dequeued"
- no parameter for proof/satisfaction reason
- no guard against active non-complete goal
- no distinction between explicit user removal and agent-claimed satisfaction

queue-steering.ts:
- says dequeue_goal after concrete goals requested by orchestration item are complete/satisfied
- but this is prompt guidance only; tool permits premature dequeue

AGENTS.md:
- tells agents to dequeue prose item only after concrete template goal is satisfied
- prompt guidance failed under operator error

tools.ts clear_goal:
- clear_goal sends queue steering when queue exists
- the remediation goal creation path used clear_goal to replace a completed goal because create_goal_from_template tool schema exposed by harness could not pass required flags
